{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29230","headline":"送林处士自闽中道越由霅抵两川 · 许浑","name":"送林处士自闽中道越由霅抵两川","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"书劒少青眼，烟波初白头。\n乡关背梨岭，客路转苹洲。\n处困道难固，乘时恩易酬。\n镜中非访戴，劒外欲依刘。\n高枕海天暝，落帆江雨秋。\n鼍声应远鼓，蜃气学危楼。\n智士役千虑，达人经百忧。\n唯闻陶靖节，多在醉乡游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}